{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"user-6","name":"プロデューサー","text":"あれ、レッスンがあるんじゃなかった？","trans":"咦，你不是有课程吗？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901200740020","name":"美琴","text":"レッスンの前に、これ渡しておこうと思って","trans":"我想在课程开始前，先把这个交给你","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-10","name":"プロデューサー","text":"これは──いいのか？","trans":"这个──可以吗？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901200740030","name":"美琴","text":"うん","trans":"嗯","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901200740040","name":"美琴","text":"知ってた？\r\n渡すものによって意味、違うみたいだよ","trans":"你知道吗？\n送的东西不同，含义好像也不一样哦","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-13","name":"プロデューサー","text":"へぇ、これはどういう意味なんだ？","trans":"哦，那这个是什么意思？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901200740050","name":"美琴","text":"特別な人、だって","trans":"听说是『特别的人』","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901200740060","name":"美琴","text":"プロデューサーにピッタリだね","trans":"和制作人很相配呢","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}